      "raw": "Templates for creating and updating loyalty rewards in bulk in the Capillary platform.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Templates for creating and updating loyalty rewards in bulk in the Capillary platform.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "lines": [
        11,
        11
      ],
      "raw": "Loyalty and rewards templates let you create and update rewards in bulk by ingesting reward data from an FTP or SFTP location on a schedule. Each template provides a pre-configured block sequence for a specific loyalty or rewards use case. You select a template, configure the block details for your environment, and deploy the dataflow.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Loyalty and rewards templates let you create and update rewards in bulk by ingesting reward data from an FTP or SFTP location on a schedule. Each template provides a pre-configured block sequence for a specific loyalty or rewards use case. You select a template, configure the block details for your environment, and deploy the dataflow.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "lines": [
        13,
        13
      ],
      "raw": "The following templates are available for loyalty and rewards.",
