    {
      "i": 5,
      "lines": [
        15,
        15
      ],
      "raw": "## Create rewards",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Create rewards",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "lines": [
        17,
        17
      ],
      "raw": "Use this template to create or update rewards in bulk from a source file. The template reads reward records from a CSV file, maps each record to the reward schema, and calls the Capillary reward creation API for every record.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Use this template to create or update rewards in bulk from a source file. The template reads reward records from a CSV file, maps each record to the reward schema, and calls the Capillary reward creation API for every record.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "lines": [
        19,
        19
      ],
      "raw": "**Use case**",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Use case",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "lines": [
        21,
        21
      ],
      "raw": "A brand preparing a seasonal loyalty campaign needs to load hundreds of new rewards into its catalog before the campaign goes live. The reward details are exported from the brand's merchandising system to a CSV file. This template reads the file, transforms each row into the reward format, and creates every reward in a single scheduled run.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "A brand preparing a seasonal loyalty campaign needs to load hundreds of new rewards into its catalog before the campaign goes live. The reward details are exported from the brand's merchandising system to a CSV file. This template reads the file, transforms each row into the reward format, and creates every reward in a single scheduled run.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "lines": [
        23,
        23
      ],
      "raw": "The template runs seven blocks in sequence: it reads the source file over SFTP, decrypts the content, converts the CSV rows to JSON, applies two transforms to map the data to the reward schema, filters out header or invalid rows, and posts each reward to the reward creation API.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "The template runs seven blocks in sequence: it reads the source file over SFTP, decrypts the content, converts the CSV rows to JSON, applies two transforms to map the data to the reward schema, filters out header or invalid rows, and posts each reward to the reward creation API.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
