      "raw": "| Block Name                                                                                                                 | Configuration Field          | Configured Value                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n| :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **[Connect-to-source](https://docs.capillarytech.com/docs/sftp-read-block)**<br />Type: `sftp_read`                        | Hostname                     | `data.capillarydata.com`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n|                                                                                                                            | Username                     | `null`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n|                                                                                                                            | Source directory             | `null`                                                                  