lock)**<br />Type: `convert_csv_to_json` | File type                    | `5c5b9607-0173-1000-87ad-a0b9ca44885f`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n|                                                                                                                            | Alphabetical sort            | `false`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n|                                                                                                                            | Group size                   | `1`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n|                                                                                                                            | JSONPath expression          | `$.[*]`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n|                                                                                                                            | Split response               | `true`                                                                                                                                                                    