sformation               | `if (is-array(.)) [ for (.) {} ] else {}`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| **[Transform-data-jolt](https://docs.capillarytech.com/docs/jolt-block)**<br />Type: `jolt_transform`                      | JOLT transformation          | Maps the source fields to the reward schema. Shifts `rewards.standard.*`, language-specific info, reward-level and customer-level restrictions, payment configs, and custom fields into their target paths, then splits `categories` on commas and converts each value to an integer. |\n| **[Filter-Data](https://docs.capillarytech.com/docs/filter-hidden-block)**<br />Type: `filter_on_condition_hidden`         | Filter condition             | `${header_value:equals('true'):or(${header_value:isEmpty()})}`                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| **[Connect-to-destination](https://docs.capillarytech.com/docs/api-request-http_write-block)**<br />Type: `http_write`     | Client key                   | `null`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n|                                                                                                                            | Client secret                | Redacted                                                                                                                                                                                                                 